---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---

<section class="section section-tint relative">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-rows-2">
      <div class="glass-card reveal lg:row-span-2 lg:flex lg:flex-col lg:justify-start">
        <span class="icon-tile" style="--tint: var(--accent-cyan)">
          <Icon name="target" class="h-5 w-5" />
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-headline-md mt-5 text-on-surface">Turn More Conversations Into Qualified Opportunities</h3>
        <p class="text-body-lg mt-4 text-on-surface-variant">
          Ralvie helps your business capture leads while customer interest is high. It can collect names, contact
          details, locations, service requirements, budgets and other information relevant to your sales process,
          then organise these details and send them to the appropriate team or connected system.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-lg mt-5 text-on-surface-variant">
          Your employees receive complete and structured lead information, allowing them to spend less time
          collecting basic details and more time moving opportunities forward.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card reveal">
        <span class="icon-tile" style="--tint: var(--accent-blue)">
          <Icon name="calendar" class="h-5 w-5" />
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-body-lg mt-4 font-semibold text-on-surface">Book Appointments Directly From Any Conversation</h3>
        <p class="text-body-md mt-3 text-on-surface-variant">
          Ralvie connects with your business calendar to help customers schedule appointments through phone, chat,
          SMS or web voice. It checks available time slots, collects the required booking information and sends
          confirmation details automatically — plus reminders and rescheduling based on your business rules.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card reveal">
        <span class="icon-tile" style="--tint: var(--accent-violet)">
          <Icon name="users" class="h-5 w-5" />
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-body-lg mt-4 font-semibold text-on-surface">Connect Every Customer With the Right Person</h3>
        <p class="text-body-md mt-3 text-on-surface-variant">
          Ralvie understands the reason for each conversation before deciding where it should go. Calls and
          enquiries can be routed by intent, department, language, location, urgency or availability, and when
          human assistance is required, Ralvie transfers the conversation along with the customer information it
          has already collected — so nobody has to repeat themselves.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
